(F5 T2 V4: print_group_data with two names (manual 6.991) fills
 element_print_group_data_values (6.446) with their values for the group
 of the element. The input also holds the Professional singular spelling
 element_print_group_data_value, overwritten by the calculation. Expected,
 = Professional 02-08-2026: element_print_group_data_values 1 1000 0.3.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
print_group_data -group_materi_elasti_young -group_materi_elasti_poisson
element_print_group_data_value 1 7.
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
